description:
Use this when converting between YAML and JSON in either direction, or normalizing one format in place (set from equal to to). Deterministic: same input, same output. Parses a single YAML document and caps alias expansion at 100 to defuse billion-laughs bombs; multi-document input, tabs-as-indentation, and other parse errors return a typed error with the line number. Example: { data: "name: web
port: 8080", from: "yaml", to: "json" } -> { result: "{
  "name": "web",
  "port": 8080
}" }.
